日常的なやり取りを描いていただきたいのですが、先生にお任せします。\n\n使用範囲について\n\n有料小説の挿絵、SNSでの宣伝、少部数の印刷に使用させていただけると幸いです。\n\nもしご依頼内容が不適切な場合は、いつでもお気軽にお断りください。\n金額が合わない場合は、修正して再度ご依頼いただければと思います。\n\nお忙しいところ恐れ入りますが、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 107555, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "𓅿ﾓﾛﾂﾖｼ👿✊依頼はskebのみ", "screen_name": "moro_244", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976122226131992578/lghbD1ds.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2715918024/1636784936/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 131273, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "メリー🎸🎸Skeb･ご依頼受付中", "screen_name": "holysarvel", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1897295088260407296/rO3RXEnE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3174849709/1741185277/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 492924, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "エイゴニ", "screen_name": "eisuri", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1262578213672202246/VMjpGqpK.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/801718896881324032/1591199555/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": 48, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete